                "q": "10. Pencils are in packages of 10. Erasers are in packages of 12. A shopkeeper wants to purchase the smallest number of pencils and erasers so that he will have exactly 1 eraser per pencil. How many packages of pencils and erasers should shopkeeper buy?",
