                "a": "(1) [[5/4]] = 5 ÷ 4\n= 1.25\n(2) [[5/3]] = 5 ÷ 3\n= 1.666...\nUp to 3 decimal places = 1.666\n(3) [[4/5]] = 4 ÷ 5\n= 0.8\n(4) [[7/10]] = 7 ÷ 10\n= 0.7\n(5) [[15/7]] = 15 ÷ 7\n= 2.142857...\nUp to 3 decimal places = 2.142\n(6) [[14/9]] = 14 ÷ 9\n= 1.555...\nUp to 3 decimal places = 1.555\n(7) [[5/8]] = 5 ÷ 8\n= 0.625\n(8) [[23/9]] = 23 ÷ 9\n= 2.555...\nUp to 3 decimal places = 2.555\n(9) [[32/7]] = 32 ÷ 7\n= 4.571428...\nUp to 3 decimal places = 4.571\n(10) [[45/13]] = 45 ÷ 13\n= 3.461538...\nUp to 3 decimal places = 3.461\n(11) [[50/15]] = 50 ÷ 15\n= 3.333...\nUp to 3 decimal places = 3.333\n(12) [[9/14]] = 9 ÷ 14\n= 0.642857...\nUp to 3 decimal places = 0.642\n(13) [[11/16]] = 11 ÷ 16\n= 0.6875\n(14) [[5/12]] = 5 ÷ 12\n= 0.41666...\nUp to 3 decimal places = 0.416\n(15) [[17/20]] = 17 ÷ 20\n= 0.85\n(16) [[125/60]] = 125 ÷ 60\n= 2.08333...\nUp to 3 decimal places = 2.083\n(17) [[245/26]] = 245 ÷ 26\n= 9.423076...\nUp to 3 decimal places = 9.423\n(18) [[250/8]] = 250 ÷ 8\n= 31.25\n(19) [[300/250]] = 300 ÷ 250\n= 1.2\n(20) [[23/25]] = 23 ÷ 25\n= 0.92"
