                "a": "(1) 2.3\nTenths digit is 3, less than 5\n= 2\n(2) 5.6\nTenths digit is 6, greater than 5\n= 6\n(3) 7.7\nTenths digit is 7, greater than 5\n= 8\n(4) 6.6\nTenths digit is 6, greater than 5\n= 7\n(5) 9.9\nTenths digit is 9, greater than 5\n= 10\n(6) 8.3\nTenths digit is 3, less than 5\n= 8\n(7) 7.8\nTenths digit is 8, greater than 5\n= 8\n(8) 50.2\nTenths digit is 2, less than 5\n= 50\n(9) 58.6\nTenths digit is 6, greater than 5\n= 59\n(10) 78.2\nTenths digit is 2, less than 5\n= 78\n(11) 81.7\nTenths digit is 7, greater than 5\n= 82\n(12) 99.9\nTenths digit is 9, greater than 5\n= 100"
