                "q": "Measure the reflex angles by using protractor.\n(i) In the figure, the small angle between the rays is 25°.\n(ii) In the figure, the small angle between the rays is 30°.\n(iii) In the figure, the small angle between the rays is 90°.\n(iv) In the figure, the small angle between the rays is 80°.",
                "a": "(i) Reflex angle = 360° − 25°\n= 335°\n(ii) Reflex angle = 360° − 30°\n= 330°\n(iii) Reflex angle = 360° − 90°\n= 270°\n(iv) Reflex angle = 360° − 80°\n= 280°"
