                "q": "Draw and label the following angles:\n(i) ∠ABC (reflex angle)\n(ii) ∠DEF (straight angle)\n(iii) ∠GHI (reflex angle)\n(iv) ∠PQR (right angle)\n(v) ∠STU (straight angle)\n(vi) ∠XYZ (reflex angle)",
                "a": "(i) Draw two rays from B making a reflex angle (more than 180° and less than 360°) and label it ∠ABC.\n(ii) Draw two rays from E in opposite directions making a straight line and label it ∠DEF = 180°.\n(iii) Draw two rays from H making a reflex angle and label it ∠GHI.\n(iv) Draw two rays from Q perpendicular to each other and label it ∠PQR = 90°.\n(v) Draw two rays from T in opposite directions making a straight line and label it ∠STU = 180°.\n(vi) Draw two rays from X making a reflex angle and label it ∠XYZ."
