                "a": "(i) Reflex angle = 310°\nSmall angle = 360° − 310°\n= 50°\nDraw ∠ABC with the small angle 50°; the reflex angle is 310°.\n(ii) Reflex angle = 280°\nSmall angle = 360° − 280°\n= 80°\nDraw ∠DEF with the small angle 80°; the reflex angle is 280°.\n(iii) Reflex angle = 340°\nSmall angle = 360° − 340°\n= 20°\nDraw ∠LMN with the small angle 20°; the reflex angle is 340°.\n(iv) Reflex angle = 290°\nSmall angle = 360° − 290°\n= 70°\nDraw ∠OPQ with the small angle 70°; the reflex angle is 290°."
