                "a": "Arrange the numbers in ascending order:\n100, 100, 100, 100, 100, 104, 104, 105, 105, 105, 105, 105, 105, 108, 110, 110, 110, 110, 115, 115\nTally table:\nHeight | Tally marks | Number of students\n100 cm | ||||/ | 5\n104 cm | || | 2\n105 cm | ||||/ | | 6\n108 cm | | | 1\n110 cm | |||| | 4\n115 cm | || | 2"
