                "q": "1. Find the average of following numbers:\n(i) 4, 3, 5, 8, 6, 10.\n(ii) 10, 20, 30, 40, 50",
                "a": "(i) Sum of numbers = 4 + 3 + 5 + 8 + 6 + 10 = 36\nNumber of numbers = 6\nAverage = 36 ÷ 6 = 6\n(ii) Sum of numbers = 10 + 20 + 30 + 40 + 50 = 150\nNumber of numbers = 5\nAverage = 150 ÷ 5 = 30"
