                "a": "(i) Sum of numbers = 5 + 15 + 30 + 10 + 20 = 80\nNumber of numbers = 5\nAverage = 80 ÷ 5 = 16\n(ii) Sum of numbers = 20 + 40 + 30 + 35 = 125\nNumber of numbers = 4\nAverage = 125 ÷ 4 = 31.25\n(iii) Picture graph"
