                    "q": "Scientific Problem Solving: This farmer is worried about his field. The soil is holding too much water and is poorly drained. The situation might badly affect the plants.\nWhich component of the soil gets missing when the soil holds too much water?\nHow can the farmer improve the soil in his field for better crop growth? Which soil mineral needs to be added so that the soil does not soak up water?"
